      "questionText": "<p><strong>Vi&#7871;t ra c&#225;c t&#7915;/c&#7909;m t&#7915; l&#224; d&#7845;u hi&#7879;u nh&#7853;n bi&#7871;t c&#7911;a th&#236; hi&#7879;n t&#7841;i &#273;&#417;n trong c&#225;c c&#226;u sau.</strong></p>\n<p>Example: The buses go <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">every 10 minutes</span>. =&gt; <strong>every 10 minutes</strong></p>\n<p>1. Joseph buys a newspaper every Saturday. =&gt; <span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.1</label><input id='fbo-896002-0' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='0' name='fbo-896002-0' type='text' size='18' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-896002-0' /></span></p>\n<p>2. Adam and Bella don't have to do homework on weekends. =&gt; <span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.2</label><input id='fbo-896002-1' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='1' name='fbo-896002-1' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-896002-1' /></span></p>\n<p>3. People are often afraid of things they don't understand. =&gt; <span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.3</label><input id='fbo-896002-2' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='2' name='fbo-896002-2' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-896002-2' /></span></p>\n<p>4. Children normally feel a lot of anxiety about their first day at school. =&gt; <span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.4</label><input id='fbo-896002-3' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='3' name='fbo-896002-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-896002-3' /></span></p>\n<p>5. My mom helps me bake cookies three times a month. =&gt; <span class='fillblank-option'><label>1.5</label><input id='fbo-896002-4' class='ms fillblank-option-1' index='4' name='fbo-896002-4' type='text' size='20' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-896002-4' /></span></p>",
