      "questionName": "Question 3",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><em>Give the correct form of the verb in the brackets.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Annually, the National Eisteddfod festival of Wales (take) <span class='fillblank-option'><input id='fbo-69635-0' class='ms fillblank-option-9' index='0' name='fbo-69635-0' type='text' size='7' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-69635-0' /></span> place for eight days at the start of August.</strong></p>",
